d keep going until the work is done.\n\nKeep the workspace clean. Leave intentional changes but remove any temporary files or scripts you created before finishing.","composition":{"schema":1,"contentChars":1914},"forcedRole":true,"messageId":"8fe46e81-fd8a-4389-bb6e-33f385246c47"}}
